WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.143
Today we will shape a useful object from malleable material. Our work connects with

00:00:05.143 --> 00:00:07.261
selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:13.326
Roll a smooth ball of soft material. Name a design choice that a selected Ghanaian

00:00:13.326 --> 00:00:14.367
artist might make.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.040
Press a thumb gently into the centre and pinch the sides evenly.

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:22.725
Smooth the rim and show how the finished bowl can stand.
